    "text": "A special event (鬼斯神秘夜) at the official Pokémon card gyms in mainland China, held in the evenings from 26 October to 25 November 2026. Each tournament of at least eight players ran three to five Swiss rounds of single games. Its prize card was a full-art Gastly, 420/SV-P: the winner of each tournament got one, and for every eight players one more who had not won was drawn to get one, up to four draws a tournament, while stocks lasted.",
